<H2><SPAN id=3DBackground class=3Dmw-headline>Background</SPAN></H2>
<P>The Golden Witch, and instigator of the Rokkenjima murders from =
October 1986.=20
Beatrice serves as Battler's main enemy in Umineko no Naku Koro ni, and =
later on=20
as his best ally. In Ougon Musou Kyoku, Beatrice fights primarily for =
the=20
existence of her endless game, and to keep Ange away from Battler while =
she's at=20
it. </P>
<H2><SPAN id=3DIntroduction class=3Dmw-headline>Introduction</SPAN></H2>
<P>Beatrice is an odd, yet versatile character. Her special moves seem =
catered=20
towards a zoning playstyle, but her projectile game falls short compared =
to=20
characters like Siesta410 and Virgilia. Beatrice's true advantage lies =
in her=20
supers. With meter, Beatrice's combo ability, okizeme, and mixup =
potential all=20
take a considerable leap, and makes her pressure a force to be reckoned =
with.=20
</P>
<P>Health - 1400.<BR></P>
<H2><SPAN id=3DChanges class=3Dmw-headline>Changes</SPAN></H2>
<P><B>Patch 2.10</B> <BR></P>
<P>- As of patch 2.10, Beato's 6B overhead is no longer cancellable =
unless you=20
charge it up beforehand.<BR></P>
<H2><SPAN id=3DAbility class=3Dmw-headline>Ability</SPAN></H2>
<P><I>Infinity SP</I> - For a short period of time, this will allow you =
to use a=20
single SP super for no cost once. </P>
