<H2><SPAN id=3DSample_Combos class=3Dmw-headline>Sample =
Combos</SPAN></H2>
<P><I>Feel free to edit this part of the wiki with your tips/strats what =
combos=20
to use. Remember I'm watching you.</I> </P>
<P><I>2A &gt; 2B &gt; 5B &gt; 5C &gt; 3C &gt; 623A/B/C</I> - Basic BnB =
combo.=20
</P>
<P><I>2A &gt; 2B &gt; 5B &gt; 3C &gt; 623A+B &gt; 6C &gt; j8.A &gt; j8.C =
&gt;=20
214A+B &gt; (5A &gt; j8.A &gt; j8.C &gt; 214A+B)xN</I> - High damaging =
corner=20
combo. </P>
<DL>
  <DD>
  <DL>
    <DD>
    <UL>
      <LI>If Beatrice has no SP, she can instead finish with 236A. </LI>
      <LI>xN means that she can repeat this as long as she likes, until =
she runs=20
      out of SP or the opponent is stunned. =
</LI></UL></DD></DL></DD></DL>
<P><I>... &gt; (3C &gt; 623A+B)xN</I> - Loop that can be done anywhere =
in the=20
screen. </P>
<DL>
  <DD>
  <DL>
    <DD>
    <UL>
      <LI>Not a very high damaging combo, but great for setting up a =
stun=20
      finisher. </LI></UL></DD></DL></DD></DL>
